# Compiled object files, static and dynamic libraries
*.o
*.a
*.so

# Binaries, test binaries and profiles
*.exe
*.test
*.prof
/bin
bin/
debug/

# Output of the go coverage tool
*.out
coverage.txt

# External packages
vendor/

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# Logs
*.log

# A scratch main.go at the top of the repository, so that a manual test does
# not get committed. The leading slash keeps it to the top: without it the
# pattern would match a main.go at any depth.
/main.go
